## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Control Default (Mid)

- Items: Demon Boots, Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Genius Wand, Divine Glaive, Immortality
- Core: Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Genius Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Demon Boots when Use when blue-side rotations are calm enough that cooldown tempo matters more than mana comfort.; Wishing Lantern over Genius Wand when Use when enemy tanks and fighters are the main targets standing inside repeated fireballs.; Blood Wings over Immortality when Use when Valir is not the first dive target and the last slot can stay shielded damage instead of revive insurance.
- Total cost: 10900 gold

Default ranked mid build for repeated burn, slow stacking, and safe peel when Valir must control river fights without running out of mana.

### Frontline Burn Lantern (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive, Holy Crystal
- Core: Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Wishing Lantern
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flameshot
- Flex: Demon Boots over Magic Boots when Use when extended side-lane defenses or low-blue games make mana more important than maximum cooldown pressure.; Genius Wand over Holy Crystal when Use when the enemy has multiple low-to-mid Magic Defense targets and your team benefits from stacked shred.; Blood Wings over Holy Crystal when Use when late fights are decided by whether Valir survives one gap-close after his ultimate cleanse.
- Total cost: 12020 gold

Front-to-back setup for durable drafts where Valir can keep the same target burning and slowed long enough for Wishing Lantern to matter.

### Anti-Dive Utility (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive, Immortality
- Core: Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy dive is burst-heavy but not crowd-control-heavy enough to justify Fortitude.; Brute Force Breastplate over Immortality when Use against repeated physical skill damage when Valir needs cooldown, movement, and control-duration reduction before revive value.; Radiant Armor over Immortality when Use when repeated magic poke is forcing Valir out before objective fights start.
- Total cost: 10790 gold

Defensive utility build for assassin, hard-engage, or chain-control games where Valir's job is to live through the first commit and keep marking targets for allies.

